  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 405.02 PWS Capacity Assurance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 405.02 PWS Capacity Assurance. A proposed small CWS shall comply with the capacity requirements of Env-Dw 602 before the operation of such water system begins.\n\nSource. #14158, eff 12-25-24 (formerly Env-Dw 405.03)",
